  "title": "2017 jet\u2013cyclone comparison: QG formation",
  "description": "Six regularized QG analogues of Rostami, Zeitlin & Spiga (2017): jet only, reference cyclone and stronger cyclone, each seeded with m=6 or random-phase modes 2\u20138. Resting deep layer; deformation radius 3,200 km; convection off; 36.17 Earth days. The reference and stronger cores exceed the controlled small-Rossby-number regime. These use a smoothed core and annular streamfunction seeds, rather than the paper\u2019s full shallow-water dynamics and eigenfunctions. Completion or a strong sixfold signal does not establish a stable connected hexagonal jet, convergence, or agreement with the observed drift.",
